SUMMARY:Fermenting Resistance
DESCRIPTION:During this encounter we will explore how fermentation can help us imagine and practice different ways of relating and organizing our communities. We will also reflect on the importance of creating spaces for shared manual and reproductive labour\, mutual care and collective nourishment\, exploring how these practices can become integral to the ways we organise and sustain our communities.
URL:https://plantagedok.nl/event/fermenting-resistance/
LOCATION:Dokzaal
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://plantagedok.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/2026-12-05_fermenting_resistance.jpeg
END:VEVENT
