SUMMARY:Signals Into the Ether
DESCRIPTION:  \nMany Voices Sound presents Signals Into the Ether\, a spatial listening experience on a self-built multichannel sound system. Showcasing forward-thinking sounds and experimental music\, the evening features Soumaya Phéline\, Loma Doom and Nadia\, who perform live on the Ambrio Spatial Performance Mixer. \n\n\nTickets
URL:https://plantagedok.nl/event/signals-into-the-ether/
LOCATION:Dokzaal
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://plantagedok.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Singals-into-the-ether_fin.jpg
